<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Perfect submission, perfect delight,</l><l>Visions of rapture now burst on my sight;</l><l>Angels descending, bring from above</l><l>Echoes of mercy, whispers of love.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Perfect submission, all is at rest,</l><l>I in my Savior am happy and blest;</l><l>Watching and waiting, looking above,</l><l>Filled with His goodness, lost in His love.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
